.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt CHOWN 1
.Os Project9
.Sh NAME
.Nm chown
.Nd change file ownership
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar uid Ns Op :gid
.Ar file ...
.Nm
.Ar :gid
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
sets the numeric owner and group of each file.
Omit either ID to keep it.
Root can assign any valid ID.
A file owner may change the group to their own primary group.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr chmod 1 ,
.Xr statx 2
